{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "育林"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂弈世君王種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "秦言外意謂淨行志道其種。別有經書。世世相承。或在家出家。苦行而多恃己術。自我\n慢人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云吠舍。謂商賈之種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或云成達羅。謂田農之種"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云大平等主"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此祖稅之\n\n始"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云土田主謂初分土田各有諍訟使主之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或梵云。喬答摩。或憍曇彌。二姓華言最勝。經音疏云。皆甘蔗王種也。順正理論云。喬答摩種。生於日光"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今詳二經前就本緣後約功德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隋言別成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今詳。必因樹命國。從國稱氏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華言能仁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詳此二譯初從人後就處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵云首圖䭾那。此云淨飯王。即\n佛父也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今稱沙門釋者。蓋天竺出家。外\n道亦自稱沙門。今以釋字簡之。或單稱釋亦可。若彼此是僧。即不用稱。蓋同一釋家。法兄弟故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "懣門字上聲呼之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道即八支聖道也。若有其道。自行邪行。非生道器。故名污道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有云。出家者\n具正信正因。發勇捍心。求佛果大菩提。誓度一切眾生。真實大心者。方能震動魔宮爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即持戒名破惡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡夫持戒比丘隨信隨戒法故。必在受道下稱也。問污道比丘堪為福田否。答大婆沙論云污道比丘雖破\n戒而不破見。雖破加行不破意樂信有因果如是正見意。樂九十六種外道所無。但施主於彼起正信。不\n生嫌惡。自生大福矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別解脫經。即\n\n戒本也。此㪯隅爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今略稱僧也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此士自達磨西來距曹溪能大師。六人得稱祖師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "年臘多者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "了達法性內有智德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "假號之者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "準百一羯󱷿云。雖夏臘六十。應須是知律。有\n戒行者。方名耆宿"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言住處者。婆沙論云。謂道及果空三摩地。能引彼力殊勝。能令身心安住不動。故名上座住處矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即律三網上座"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即壇上上座。或堂中首座"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即今禪居諸寮首座"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即計齊席上座"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上士具二利。有大心大行。亦名大士"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "道者亦同此說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧史略云。漢\n魏兩晉沙門對君王。亦只稱貧道。如南齊時帝問王儉曰。先輩沙門對帝何稱。正殿還坐否。儉對曰。\n漢魏佛法未具。不見紀傳自偽國稍盛皆稱貧道。亦聞預坐"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼經廣有說文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此加大字"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所言主者猶僧官也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "玄五歲便能吟詩。出家為沙彌。年十四講涅槃經。時李商隱有詩贈云。十四沙彌解講經。似師年幾只\n携鉼。沙彌說法沙門聽。不在年高在性靈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如廣知請讀僧史略"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云大愛道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未詳"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文多不載"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "名義同前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此出家五眾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此在家二眾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐言勤策男即沙彌也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐言勤策女即沙彌尼也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鴻臚即司賓寺也。胡廣釋云。鴻聲也。臚傳也。所以傳聲贊道九賓也。秦有典客。\n漢乃因之。至唐改為同文寺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出苑法師經音義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寺也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "唐宣宗諡大覺法師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云鼓聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此方君子亦有居庵者咸榮緒。晉\n書云。陶琰年十五便絕粒居草庵。戈可容身○逸士傳云陶潛居蓬庵○神仙傳云。焦光居草庵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云童壽"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若今禪居寮舍也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若今寺院內各各住持者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "殿者即此方之制。上安𩿒魚尾者是也。尾今呼為𩿒\n吻訛也。灸轂子云。漢柏梁殿災天火也。越巫献術取𩿒魚尾置上以禳之。今則象也。若古制尾上更加鐵\n作水草之形。俗呼為攢鳥者。風俗通曰。古殿多刻蓮荷菱葉之屬水草所以厭火也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡寺壁有畫大神者即是此神也。或問世界之內伽藍無數。何只十八神而能遍護耶。答一切神皆有無數\n\n眷屬。即是分任守護也無妨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "報佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "難字平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "八正道者正語。正業。正命。此三屬戒。小乘以戒為先故。正定。正勤。正念。此三屬定。定因戒得\n故次也。正見。正思惟。此二屬惠。惠因定發故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滅即涅槃也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無上心者。兼載萬有。不遺一物也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此因羅睺羅不告出家故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此因不隨心行起三毒業。為戒所制。故云不自在也。以現招清淨\n名文言當來感天人樂果。故云樂也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓋勝出家不修善根污道之者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "慈。悲。喜。捨。為四無\n量心。婆沙論云。授與饒益。是慈相。除去衰損。是悲相。慶慰。得捨。是喜相。心懷平等。是捨相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文多不載"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂親他勝於自無損。橫生妬忌。是\n名嫉妬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六念者。念佛。念法。念僧。念戒。念施。念天也。出深功德經云。此六念法。是菩提心生。菩提法故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "白虎通云父矩也。以法教子故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "但是依學一切事業乃至一日皆得稱師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "發正"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此即壇上和尚也四分云同和尚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受戒十夏已前。西天皆\n彌小師"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此蓋輕呼之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "司馬彪曰徒弟\n子也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "舉要言之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "好廣知者自檢讀之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言見親教捨依止者謂弟子在一處侍稟學師次忽受業師來即捨稟受來侍立受業師左右也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "度此小兒。亦不作童子。便剃髮號。\n驅鳥沙彌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未見譯語"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此悉達太子。剃髮之時言也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今剃髮後。父母拜賀。亦此二緣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即佛母也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此父母拜緣略引為證今國家有制。慎勿違之。五分律。佛言非我所制。餘方為清淨者不得不行。此謂\n王法不得不依也。○薩婆多論云。比丘違王制者犯突吉羅罪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今呼沙彌為法公也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西天一切帛未剪者皆呼為衣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "向下聽制篇義同此也。謂律中佛有聽衣。制衣故云二衣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即大衣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即七條也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即五條也。此是三衣也。若呼七條。偏衫。裙。為三衣\n者。誤之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "園即寺院"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律中三衣。各有廣長肘量既佛言度身而衣更不錄也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謹按四分律云上色衣不得畜。當壞作迦沙色。\n今曇無德部。即四分所宗自著赤衣。是南方正色。與諸部皆競違佛制。今試論之。以累見天竺來僧衣\n色證知皆似色也應是譯人以壞色難名。故托指青黃赤皂等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即溝瀆中泥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此說壞新\n衣之色也。今云。染色亦無出此三也。今詳禪僧多著墨黲衣若深色者。可是律中皂黑衣攝緣用墨靛與\n雜泥不遠故若淡而青白者可是律中青衣攝以用銅青板緣雜墨染故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "密也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律中遮此經開"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "義淨云。僧伽胘。\n唐言重復衣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自九條至二十五條。得用物夾作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧祇"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "抄略不次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西國㲲幅只闊故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "酉夭人亡衣屬以衣贈送至林却取施僧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "脫厄衣也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大衣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七條"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "業謂習誦等事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五條"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七條"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "葉即衣相"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "袒即肉袒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "披即通覆\n兩肩。袒即偏露右臂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記云。隨供養者。如見佛。禮佛。問許三師。入眾等時也。作福田者。謂計齊坐禪。誦經。入聚落。樹下坐時。\n使人見田相端嚴故。若對佛通披者。五百生墮鐵甲地獄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此名覆膊。亦名掩腋衣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今開脊接領者蓋遺魏制也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "些字桑箇切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧或云泥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "圌音舡。即貯米圓\n器似圌而無蓋○蓋取圓義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "佛一𭢳手長二尺四寸。此合長四尺八寸。廣三尺六寸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衣即三衣也。以此證是。觸不得淨用"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上蓋臍下掩膝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今詳律言肘但用自肘蓋度身而衣也。若用尺八之肘者下文即無臂短不及之言也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "古今注云。自三代及秦皆著角襪。以帶結至踝。洎魏文乃。更其樣釋名曰。襪未也。在脚未也。崔駟銘\n曰。建子之月。助養和氣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即八戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即別解脫戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五戒五聚戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此就小乘別體住持三寶說也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "在家人受。則云邪婬。若出家人受。則云離非梵行緣。一切都斷故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前四是性戒。後一是遮戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此戒俗人受。從今\n旦至明旦不犯為要期也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前納體貴後納人勝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂在七眾下。不受戒俗人上也。名中間人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此十戒名無盡戒者。婆沙云。菩薩尸羅無我我所離一切所\n得滅諸戲論故名無盡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此戒止是持作是犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此戒作是持止\n是犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此戒。作是持。止是犯"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘四尼八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘\n十三。尼十七"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘一百二十。尼二百八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘四尼\n八"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "比丘并尼各一百"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "羯磨華辨事百論云。謂辨事道法。有成濟故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "思者業也。有能招感當來果之功用故正\n法念處經云。思為勝戒。因種子即因義也。又云。思勝故其果則大"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "思即是第六識相應善思也。又名\n無表色。有止惡防非功能。故云護"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "二十二法者。謂。遍行五。一觸。二作意。三受。四想。五\n思別境有五。一欲。二勝解。三念。四定。五惠。善有十一。謂一信。二精進。三慚。四愧。五無貪。六\n無嗔。七無癡。八輕安。九不放逸。十行捨。十一不害。并同時心王即意識也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七支者。謂三身業\n四口業也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即高貴卿公也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "逆推至佛法初到。後漢\n求平十年丁卯。經一百七十八年。凡出家者。惟受三歸戒故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁云功德鎧"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "要知壇式請看圖經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上品心。即是於萬境上。起慈護也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文多不載"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即捨戒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即男變女女變男時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂受惡戒邪見"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即身死"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "業疏問云。\n此識種子即應能為未來後習何得言形終戒捨。答種由思生。要期是願。願得盡形壽持今壽終則戒捨。\n增輝記云。思心之上熏成種子設至命終心心所法傳至中有思種功德招感善果。此終不失今言形終捨者。\n但捨受戒時要期語者謂受戒言盡形壽能持不犯等語故順正理論云於命終後雖有要期而不能生別解脫戒\n無加行故無憶念故乃齊此捨矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今僧齊後不食果菜等是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "偈在後文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼經廣有說文。此五常福報。若施者得當來報受者獲現在樂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今析十利者。一色。二力。三壽。四樂。\n五詞清。俱舍云。詞謂訓釋言詞也。六辨。俱舍云。辨謂展轉言無滯礙也。七宿食消。八風除。九消飢。十消\n渴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀去聲。凡喫粥食。先須端想。誦之訖方食。蓋自警也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智度論云。此食墾植收穫舂磨淘汰炊煑及成。用工甚多。一鉢之飯。作夫流汗。\n食少汗多○僧祇律云。施主減其妻子之分求福故施"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "毘尼母云。若不坐禪誦經。營三寶事。不持戒。受人信施為施。所墮缺。則不宜全則可也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "明了論疏云。出家先須防心三過謂於上味食起\n貪下味食起嗔。中味食起癡。以此不知慚愧。隨三惡道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "形苦者。即飢渴為主病。四百四病為客病。故須以食為醫療用扶持之。若食粥可云不正良藥"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不食成病。道業何從。故假叚食資身也。古\n人云。先結欵狀既食不可忘於修道"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "準論。須口口作念。若省繁。但初口三匙。總念亦得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以食出生時。默誦此偈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "施食有二種。若施曠野鬼神者。即是同食寺院。佛令設\n二供養位一曠野鬼神一鬼子母並取僧食呼名施之。若比丘各自備一斛食施者。即依焦面大士經。施與\n餓鬼也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "憍慢"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "長字平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵語。陀那鉢底。唐言施主。今稱檀那者。即訛。陀為檀。去鉢底。留那故也。攝大乘論云。能破慳悋嫉妬\n及貧窮下賤苦故。稱陀。後得大富。及能引福德資糧故。稱那。又呼檀越者檀者施也。謂此人行檀。能越貧\n\n窮海故○君子者禮記云。博聞強識而讓。曰君子○長者。韓子云。重厚自居。曰長者。若天竺皆是大富者\n稱之○居士者。度論云。除四姓外。通名居士。此非所要恐訃請忽有項問亦補缺布也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "宣律師云。下之赴上曰赴。上之赴下曰訃"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "年歲即夏臘也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勞去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "赴請眾上座名住家"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡赴請。必先問賓宅中所諱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以食不足故也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "故知行香非始今世"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若今念如來妙色身三節文。出勝鬘經。今呼行香梵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "五分法身名香者。增一經云。佛言有妙香三種。謂戒香。聞香。\n施香。此三種逆風順風皆香。最為殊妙。無與等有。今詳戒香為因。能生定惠二香。解脫解脫知見二香。\n即果。從因以名之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "撰文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出涅槃經\n第二卷。迦葉菩薩問偈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出超日經。京師僧齋畢嚫後。亦如講散。再焚香唱此偈了。僧方起。極生人善"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出四分律第一卷偈"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "出四分律偈末"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陳錢塘高僧真觀有八能。則唱導一也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "清言弟子者。梁武帝云。表裏俱淨。垢穢惑累俱盡。信正不信邪故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "智度論云。以諸佛語妙善之法。為人說是法施。又云。常以好語有所\n利益是名法施。又云。非但言說名為法施。又云。若常以淨心善思以教一切。是名法施。譬如財施不以善\n心。不名福德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "食後說法。其儀久亡。今浙僧食次誦一卷般若心經。亦是說法法施也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "楊枝"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "藏中亦有休糧方法蓋防比丘有難\n事故。若不食則與自餓外道同儔也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蓌音挫拜失容又云詐也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衣即袈裟也。五百問云。不褰三衣禮拜。得眾多罪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音雞"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "凡釋氏致書俗人。即不得言稽首頓首。謂涉拜也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "者。先意問訊。謙下軟語。不生慢憍。若見年德於己少者。應先意軟語。心不輕慢。設其有罪終不譏刺"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此以受戒先後。不以尊卑。若法門弟姪之行。必須依服序之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言一切供養即見佛禮佛及禮二師等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上平患切。下口爪切。淮南謂開膝坐為跘跨。江東謂之甲趺\n\n坐也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三衣。尼師壇。鉢。濾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "非謂別有六物"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經音義第六是針筒"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "綴謂校釘"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "戒本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "連綴也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鍵音處。\n𨩲音咨。經音疏云。鉢中之小鉢。助鉢用故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧祇同"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此律言。小鉢即十誦大鍵𨩲也。次鉢即半鉢也。淮諸律四事可見也。今呼為𮣊子。𮣊音訓切。𭨂云鐵\n類也。非器故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今呼鉢囊也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼經大有訓釋名字說作亭分表法持法功德文多不錄在定字函"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "日中即知"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "百八結者。小乘見修合\n論煩惱共有一百八數且明見惑三界四諦下煩惱共有八十八。謂苦下具一切即十使。貪瞋癡慢疑身邊見。\n邪見。見取戒禁取也。集滅離三見謂集滅二諦下各除身邊耶三見也道除於二見謂道諦除身邊二見也上界\n不行恚謂上界四諦下各除瞋一。已上三界四諦共有八十八也。修道所斷惑欲界有四謂貪瞋癡慢上二界\n各除瞋共有六已上成十計九十八也。更加十纏謂無慚無愧昏沈惡作惱嫉掉舉睡眠忿覆合前都有一百八\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼經廣有說文。繁不具錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善助"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言𥎞用鐵即小拄杖子非今擔衣鉢大者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "策杖有禮。呂氏春秋日。孔子弟氏抱杖而問其父。拄杖而問兄弟。曳杖而問妻子。\n蓋尊卑之差也。凡策杖若見尊宿并二師皆須投杖於地問訊。或是二師杖必倚著處然有問訊若為二師揉\n杖師有願問必抱杖以對之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "用絹三尺或二尺隨時大小作絹須細密不透虫者若用疎絹薄紗紵布者本無護生之意"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陰陽瓶也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "以絹繫口以繩懸況。於水待滿引出"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言衣角者非袈裟角也但取密絹方一探手或繫瓶口或安鉢中濾水用也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "似今涼傘也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "字平聲即開許也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音伩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "字羅之去聲成屬"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言異道即偷稅私挫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漢言辯才"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "漢言固活"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂食不可意。或蒲腹不調。更食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "不節"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂往他處未知食性便強食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂食未消復食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂強制大小便"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂犯五戒。成疾及遭官法\n等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂非時入城市。及人家等。太早太夜"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂。奔牛。逸馬。馳車。醉人。惡大等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "成實論云。當捨五慳。一財物慳二法慳三"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂惜門徒家不欲別人識。恐\n失已利故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂有房舍不欲人居"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂不揚人美事恐勝已故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前三對治貪。後一對治放逸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中\n最"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論云。唯死魔實能\n奪命。餘者能為奪命因。亦能奪智惠命故。瑜珈論云。由蘊魔遍一切隨逐義。天魔障礙義。死魔。煩\n惱魔。能與死生眾生。作苦器故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因明勤懈乃述\n魔住"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "無所發菩薩經。及佛地論。頗同\n有云。十重他受用佛。亦名十身"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如來"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "字平聲呼謂具上三義故若去聲呼只有應供一義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "姓名兼稱也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "華言一切義成或云悉達多。此云財成"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云寂默"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此並約事而言也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵音那伽。此云龍非是世間業報龍。蓋取自在\n變化無礙義梵"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "新梵語也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "契經"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "應頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "授記"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "調頌"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "因緣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自說"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本\n事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方廣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "譬喻"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "論議"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "是佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即僧祇律"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁云一切有即十誦部"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梁云法鏡即四分部"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即五分部"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "未至梁地"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此云篋藏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "六塵也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "通惠大師云。為僧不預於十科。事佛徒勞於百歲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此七禮。前三約事。後四就理"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "信本為敬避廟諦也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天上"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鈔文多。但撮要言。故不次第焉"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此西域始也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "而今江浙用四月八日浴佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今淮比。乃至三京。皆用󱹃八。浴佛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "彼經有用香煎湯設壇法式"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即長生錢。謂子母滋生故無盡"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "侍佛比丘。即今殿主。白衣即淨人也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "息用名滅非死滅也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "受業和尚也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世人行孝只於一身釋氏行孝兼為七世父母可謂孝矣"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "俱舍論云"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "婆沙論。問。何故世尊。於四無色立處名。答為破外道執空處為無身涅槃。執識處為無邊意\n涅槃。執無所有處名淨聚涅槃。執非想非非想處。名世間空窣堵波涅槃。佛說為生處。非真解脫故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝欲界三惡。道四洲六天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝初禪三天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝二禪。三天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝三禪。三天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攝四禪九天"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禪中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "則得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵音正云蘇迷盧。此名妙高"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "為人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "託胎疑結位"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "表裏如酪"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "已至肉位仍極柔軟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "堅厚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "支分相現"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "諸根\n顯現"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "所依處分明現"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "泡時皰時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "胎中五時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人中五時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "具足即是富貴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此是根本"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三四"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "地獄因果。廣有章門。此但\n梗󱷁"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "都履切"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "饒益眾生"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又學經律論為三學"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "魏韋誕字仲將。誡子孫曰。書但記姓名而\n已"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "才兼百人曰英"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "才兼萬人曰傑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "菩薩本滿猛以金盛"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "或聖化物之資用。故名財也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "崇曰可謂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文選中沙門詩惟休一也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂無望也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "知量故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "善巧多故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "趣涅槃宮"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若今三學迭相是非也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今釋子稱絳帳等。有所不冝。智者思之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "肘長尺八南北三丈二尺四寸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "東西二丈\n一尺六寸"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "注函容也。\n謂講問冝相對容丈足以指劃也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "少字去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三國謂齊。陳。周"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "興為"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今浙右律寺。\n\n有比丘。聽學成名。便免知事。以此為證"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "業用也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "由是義故束此二法名躁蓋取不安之義也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "畏亦怖也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "情者。是非之主。利害之根"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "又云世八法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "熟皮曰韋"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧即眾。私即己"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "燕去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "僧眾也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今人呼爭為人我者。非也。\n言見取者。取諸見解為最勝故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂不可用饌食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "澡槃即洗足器"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "七聖財者。一信。二精進。三戒。四慚愧。五聞。六思七定惠。瓔珞經云。資用成佛故名財"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "別解脫經即戒本也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "由僧通凡聖行涉󱍮細須慈心敬名重法尊人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "推直於他。引曲向己。常省己過不說彼短。記云。巾能\n攬穢歸己令物潔淨故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "人應於眾俯仰得時"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "眾依於法動必有方"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "由無善伴舉必有時。故應忍默權同僧事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "一大"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "可依人者具五用一求聞令聞。二聞已令清淨。三能決斷是非。四通達無滯。五正見\n無曲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "蔡邕獨斷云。臈者。歲之終也。晉博士張亮議云。\n臈接也新故交接俗謂臈之明日為初歲也。今釋氏。自四月十六日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "三語者謂見聞\n疑"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "勦音巢輕捷也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "自房戶前"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記云。此的眾。若今禪居及講院寮舍也。若卒將入恐暗中\n比丘威儀不整"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此慮眾僧收拾不辨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "攲音𮗋。言取物也記作𮧡非也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "有勾當僧緣務人"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鼾音汗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謦妙"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "咤字去聲嘆也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "噴嚏"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "㖑許介切喝也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "左傳師惠過宋朝將私焉。注云。小便也。律\n云小行"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "去聲亂也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "左傳晉侯食麥𥇔如廁隱"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "恐有人在內"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此警噉糞諸鬼"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "草即籌子浙人呼廁草"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "十九已下洗淨法"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "九入眾高識可以此箴"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "與其"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "孛者即佛因中為藍達國王師時名也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "前二友不可親厚"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "間字去聲。謂被中間言語鬪亂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "謂徵其辭察有罪也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "文多不錄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上之四人。皆不用本處徒弟。並\n於十方海眾內。僉選道心身幹知因果者。打鍵椎曰。眾請之。用無常人其或心力勞倦。告眾歸堂。則別請\n能者也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "於未"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大莊嚴論云。如是眾僧者。乃是勝智之叢林。一切諸善行運。集\n在其中○又梵云。貧陀婆那。此云叢林因祖師舍那婆期居住故名之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "韶州雙峯山下。\n昔晉武侯孫曹叔良宅。建寶林寺。六祖能大師居之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "高僧傳云。齊天保二年。勅諸州\n別立禪肆"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西天祖師商那和修說法之處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "湖南東寺如會禪師徒眾多堂\n󱰝榻為之陷折。時重號禪窟"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "達磨大師面壁九年之處"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "內典錄云。罽賓禪師法秀。初至燉煌。即亡禪閣。開園百畝。植奈千株。禪眾濟濟。趣者如雲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言寮者。唐韻云同官曰寮今禪居意取多人同居共司一務故稱寮也。又欲別律住房名故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "次此"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵云悉替摩"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵云毘呵囉莎弭"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "梵云。\n\n羯磨陀那。此云知事"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "律因"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即今二寺有直月看堂者是"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今諸寺同食食既成熟乃打鐘鼓者。此\n蓋召十方僧故以此物十方有分故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "大毘婆沙論問云。盜亡\n僧物於誰處得根本業道。答若已作羯磨者於羯磨眾處得若未作羯磨者。普於一切善說法眾得今詳分亡\n僧物十方來僧在羯磨數即得羯磨後來不得"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "滅即滅名也　爾雅云。點滅如今句點𮇧滅名字也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "地不"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "界者。分段義。分齊義。住持義"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "增輝記云。即鬼子母廟也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "護伽藍神有十八。或是今土地廟也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "即今堂中聖僧也。始因\n道安法師夢一胡僧。頭白眉長悟安云。可時設食。後十誦律。至惠遠方知和尚所夢即賓頭盧也。於是\n立座飯之。寺寺成則。法苑云。聖僧元無形像。至宋泰初未正勝寺僧法願。正喜寺僧法鏡等。始圖形像\n矣。今堂中聖僧。多云。是憍陳如。非也。緣經律不令為立廟故。不走四天供故。又安法師夢是賓頭\n盧故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今見童行自稱淨人。蓋不知端\n也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "天使者。或云五天使。或云五官。即是生老病死及現世牢獄"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "地獄也。此云無喜樂"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "隨有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "令詳律。但是鐘磬。石板。木板。木魚。砧搥。有聲能集眾者。皆名犍稚也。今寺院木魚者。蓋古人不可以木\n朴擊之故。創魚象也。又必取張華相魚之名。或取鯨魚一擊𮐳勞為之大鳴也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "詳諸律。三寶皆有無盡財"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "世音"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此文又通。保安現在父\n母"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "盆會之中"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "若供養佛食。回供僧者。即此日得。他日不通。今却於\n寺中。設供亡人。蓋誤之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言隨意。即自恣也。言僧伽。即眾也。以草藉地坐也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言中者日午也。過\n\n午不得食"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "呼為贈作"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "冥間化起一相。似身傳識。謂之中有"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "中陰經云\n中有。極壽七日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "興答"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今詳此文。凡為人聲\n鐘。此為拔苦。必須依法處心扣之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "西國傳云。唐三藏親至王舍城東北。\n禮佛洗病僧塔"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "上風謂呵欠嚏嗽等"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今稱延壽堂涅槃堂者皆後人隨情愛名之也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "像後"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鈔有廣文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "鈔有問答"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "觀經云。臨終遇知識教稱十聲阿彌陀佛得生第九品十疑論問云。眾生造惡無量。云何臨終\n十念成就即得往生出過三界結業答眾生造惡是有間心臨終念佛是無間心善心猛利故承佛願力故"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "南山鈔有文"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音堪。唐韻云龕塔也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "方志云受也。廣雅云。盛也。此名蓋異俗也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "音舊"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "衰音崔或作縗"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "齊音咨"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言斬者喪君父夫心如斬截也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "經音迭言實也。傷椎之貫也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "齊音咨也。齊者㓨也。緶也。緝也。言\n喪母痛苦而刲㓨言輕於斬也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "本根也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此非釋氏所要因言其杖故委曲注之"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "時藥即食也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "多云僧亡戒捨不得禮拜若爾南山大師却云小於亡者\n至尸設禮又經中比丘化為蛇佛令有此比丘禮拜今詳必是長於亡者不禮爾"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "記云。弟子即\n亡僧弟子也以其荒迷故。執其手其師即亡僧二師也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "和尚闍梨即亡者二師也。同學小者大者即亡者弟子也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此舉哀儀也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "寒林即西域葉尸處僧祇律云。謂多死尸凡入者可畏毛寒故名寒林。今云尸陀林訛也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今禪居僧亡者。不以尊少主客並打鼓普請送葬蓋准此律"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此文似山所十念也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "今釋子。送父母塟可准此經依佛前導生人善心"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "生信"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "識銘誌也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "此又非起於漢魏也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "取要言之故略\n而不次"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "言五法者。不隨愛。不隨嗔。不隨癡。不隨怖。知得不得。亦名五德"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "疑是奪前酬價者"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "遠日。猶濫曲禮葬事先遠日"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "某甲"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "禮云。哭則不歌也"}
